corbell5571@juno.com writes:
> Subject: Re: How long does it take to set up a bear trap?

To answer the question in your subject line (which, if you wanted an answer
to it, would have been better off in the body text): it depends on your
dexterity and strength. Add the following components to get the number
of turns required:

STAT   DEX  STR
~~~~   ~~~  ~~~
< 8     5    4              
8-12    4    2
13-17   3    1
> 17    2    0

If you're blind, double the dexterity component. For land mines,
there's no strength component.

